{"id":"01_5939","type":"item","name":{"ja":"30MM 1/144 オプションパーツセット20(フルアーマーユニット1)","en":"30MM 1/144 Option parts set 20 (full armor unit 1)"},"description":[{"ja":"「30MM 1/144 eEXM-17FA フルアーマーアルト」に付属した武装や装甲が汎用性の高いグレーベースのカラーリングで、オプションパーツセットとなって登場！","en":"The weapons and armor included with \"30MM 1/144 eEXM-17FA Full Armor Alto\" are now available as an optional parts set in a highly versatile gray-based coloring!"},{"ja":"• 別売りの「アルト」はもちろん、様々なシリーズ機体を強化可能。同月発売の「イグライト 01」もパーツを取り付けることですぐにフルアーマー調にできる。","en":"• Not only the \"Alto \" sold separately, but also various series aircraft can be strengthened. \" Iglite 01\" from the same release can also be made into a full armor style by attaching parts."},{"ja":"• 機体のカスタマイズ性を引き上げる中間アーマーと大型武装が付属。","en":"• Comes with intermediate armor and large weapons that increase the customizability of the aircraft."},{"ja":"• 別売りの「アルト」以外の機体にも取り付け可能。思いのままに機体をボリュームアップ。","en":"• Can be installed on aircraft other than the \"Alto\" sold separately. Volume up the aircraft as you wish."},{"ja":"• 付属パーツは様々な箇所に取り付けが可能。シリーズ機体やエグザビークルと組み合わせて、カスタマイズを楽しめる。","en":"• Attached parts can be installed in various locations. You can enjoy customization by combining it with series aircraft and EXA vehicles."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"バックパック/アーマー×1式","en":"Backpack/Armor x 1 set"},{"ja":"キャノンブレード×2","en":"Cannon blade x2"},{"ja":"ジョイントパーツ×1式","en":"Joint parts x 1 set"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/mZ980Z6stKXtyMwA/YCWOGSmMY9OknX5z.jpeg?Expires=1765044112&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=AVR9T-qeFcPHC7D3y8vgYoIiTKeCN-6sQqZK41qxX73MY6P1Jk8Iu15IatTYO45e9jjGukWhWOofA7BtZIS04NtiuQ7CGkjbymqUyKElgXsrAIDmYf27i9ehLfEVS7~d2vP4S~sps6VY9wx4go62jsNJwceoYbhRqWoGrA8CRs2gCjWTRfPPErduJMWfbReLm0FRIclw1PAjg8SkMutNXKr6iHEPuLik0S1glr7aWDJA4Jv9aoPxilww6n0b-I9Y-OOuCLAxFlxyPo9VD12xXcxKgkFXs1cP9PzIeK1Kt7IEG7dC5vBpn4-OE3CQdFR7I8QsMKf2sw50ZrE4F0nKyw__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/jr7qxrEed8